id: pm-web-7u2y
title: Include pm-memory and pm-rlm in the package catalog and fleet snapshot
description: "The 2026-10-19 capacity-documentation release gate at public revision 8e9cc9713778f9ff945eb28c57d827d20cf75995, with explicit read-only canonical fleet metadata, reports pm-memory and pm-rlm as missing from the package catalog. The exact-package-set, fleet-completeness and committed-snapshot tests fail. The documentation-only change does not modify catalog code. Add the packages and refresh evidence in a separate change after verifying package ownership and intended capabilities. Related pm-web-h4vh; measurements and release evidence are in docs/capacity/2026-10-19-ladder.md."
